{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 34,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.3858642578125,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "TB. Children and young adolescents aged below 16 years were treated with rifampicin, isoniazid,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.5791625976562,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "pyrazinamide with or without ethambutol using WHO recommended doses, appropriate for paediatric",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.957366943359375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        92.51471710205078,
        127.88999938964844,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "(36) dosing  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.47807312011719,
        115.38463592529297,
        527.4229736328125,
        129.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "PICO question:  In children and adolescents with non-severe TB, should a four-month intervention",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        128.69459533691406,
        481.688720703125,
        143.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "regimen versus the standard six-month regimen conforming to WHO guidelines be used?",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.47807312011719,
        150.28863525390625,
        527.2994995117188,
        164.8416290283203
      ],
      "text": "Evidence:  In the SHINE trial, the primary efficacy outcome was a composite of treatment failure",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        163.59864807128906,
        527.4099731445312,
        178.04164123535156
      ],
      "text": "(including an extension of treatment beyond the replacement of missed doses, TB treatment drug",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        176.79859924316406,
        527.386962890625,
        191.24159240722656
      ],
      "text": "changes or restarts due to suspected treatment failure), on-treatment loss-to-follow-up, TB recurrence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.960428237915039,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        189.99855041503906,
        527.6025390625,
        204.44154357910156
      ],
      "text": "or death by 72 weeks (from randomization), excluding children not reaching 16 weeks follow-up",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        203.19850158691406,
        527.4113159179688,
        217.64149475097656
      ],
      "text": "(modified-intention-to-treat). The non-inferiority margin for the primary efficacy outcome was 6%.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        216.3985137939453,
        495.0624694824219,
        230.8415069580078
      ],
      "text": "The primary safety outcome was grade 3–5 adverse events recorded while on TB treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        238.10243225097656,
        527.1043090820312,
        252.54542541503906
      ],
      "text": "The SHINE trial definition of non-severe TB was: peripheral lymph node TB or respiratory TB (including",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.968955993652344,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        251.3024444580078,
        527.3143310546875,
        265.7454528808594
      ],
      "text": "uncomplicated intrathoracic lymph node disease) confined to one lobe without cavities, no significant",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.980632781982422,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        264.50238037109375,
        393.8052673339844,
        278.9454040527344
      ],
      "text": "airway obstruction, uncomplicated pleural effusion, and no miliary TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        286.2064208984375,
        527.4266967773438,
        300.6494445800781
      ],
      "text": "The SHINE trial inclusion criteria were: children and young adolescents aged <16 years; weight ≥3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        299.40643310546875,
        527.3650512695312,
        313.8494567871094
      ],
      "text": "kg; no known drug-resistance; symptomatic but non-severe TB; smear negative on gastric aspirate",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        312.60638427734375,
        524.4076538085938,
        327.0494079589844
      ],
      "text": "or other respiratory sample (an Xpert MTB/RIF positive, rifampicin susceptible result was allowed); 14",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        325.806396484375,
        527.394775390625,
        340.2494201660156
      ],
      "text": "clinician’s decision to treat with a standard first-line regimen; not treated for TB in the previous two",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.00640869140625,
        527.38916015625,
        353.4494323730469
      ],
      "text": "years; known HIV status (positive or negative). Trial exclusion criteria were: respiratory sample acid",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        352.2064208984375,
        527.3859252929688,
        366.6494445800781
      ],
      "text": "fast bacilli smear-positive (a smear-positive peripheral lymph node sample was allowed); premature",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        365.4064025878906,
        527.4507446289062,
        379.84942626953125
      ],
      "text": "birth (<37 weeks) and aged under three months; miliary TB, spinal TB, TBM, osteoarticular TB,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        378.6064147949219,
        527.4287719726562,
        393.0494384765625
      ],
      "text": "abdominal TB, congenital TB; pre-existing, non-tuberculous disease likely to prejudice the response",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        391.806396484375,
        527.3892211914062,
        406.2494201660156
      ],
      "text": "to, or assessment of, treatment (such as liver or kidney disease, peripheral neuropathy or cavitation);",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        405.00640869140625,
        527.4365844726562,
        419.4494323730469
      ],
      "text": "any known contraindication to taking TB drugs; known contact with a drug-resistant adult source",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        418.2064208984375,
        527.434326171875,
        432.6494445800781
      ],
      "text": "case (including mono-resistant TB); known drug-resistance in the child; being severely ill; pregnancy.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        439.9103088378906,
        527.2507934570312,
        454.35333251953125
      ],
      "text": "A total of 1204 children were enrolled in the trial between July 2016 and July 2018. The median age of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.981134414672852,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        453.1103210449219,
        527.2216796875,
        467.5533447265625
      ],
      "text": "enrolled children was 3.5 years (range: 2 months – 15 years), 52% were male, 11% had HIV-infection,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.994548797607422,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        466.310302734375,
        527.427490234375,
        480.7533264160156
      ],
      "text": "and 14% had bacteriologically confirmed TB. Retention in the trial by 72 weeks and adherence  to  15",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        479.51031494140625,
        527.2230834960938,
        493.9533386230469
      ],
      "text": "allocated TB treatment were 95% and 94%, respectively. Sixteen (2.8%) versus 18 (3.1%) children",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        492.7102966308594,
        527.1401977539062,
        507.1533203125
      ],
      "text": "reached the primary efficacy outcome (treatment failure) in the 16- versus 24-week arms respectively,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.982335090637207,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        505.9102783203125,
        527.411376953125,
        520.353271484375
      ],
      "text": "with an unadjusted difference of -0.3% (95% CI: -2.3, 1.6). Treatment success was reported in 97.1%",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        519.1103515625,
        527.4299926757812,
        533.5533447265625
      ],
      "text": "of participants receiving the 16-week regimen versus 96.9% in those receiving the 24-week regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        532.310302734375,
        527.3969116210938,
        546.7532958984375
      ],
      "text": "(relative risk (RR): 1.00, 95% CI: 0.98–1.02). Non-inferiority of the 16-week regimen was consistent",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        545.5103149414062,
        527.4409790039062,
        559.9533081054688
      ],
      "text": "across all intention-to-treat, per-protocol and key secondary analyses. This included restricting the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        558.7103271484375,
        527.4364624023438,
        573.1533203125
      ],
      "text": "analysis to the 958 (80%) children that were independently adjudicated to have TB at baseline by",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        571.9102783203125,
        527.4078369140625,
        586.353271484375
      ],
      "text": "the trial Endpoint Review Committee. A total of 7.8% of children experienced a grade 3–5 adverse",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        585.1102905273438,
        527.4112548828125,
        599.5532836914062
      ],
      "text": "event in the 16-week arm, versus 8.0% in the 24-week arm (RR: 0.98, 95% CI: 0.67–1.44). There were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        598.310302734375,
        527.402587890625,
        612.7532958984375
      ],
      "text": "115 on-treatment grade ≥3 adverse events in 95 (8%) children, 47 (8%) in the 16-week and 48 (8%)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        611.5103149414062,
        524.3917236328125,
        625.9533081054688
      ],
      "text": "in the 24-week arm, most common being pneumonia or other chest infections (29 (25%)) or liver-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        624.7103271484375,
        527.2396850585938,
        639.1533203125
      ],
      "text": "related events (11 (10%)) across both arms. There were 17 grade 3 or 4 adverse reactions (considered",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.981184005737305,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        637.9102783203125,
        527.3909912109375,
        652.353271484375
      ],
      "text": "possibly, probably or definitely) related to trial drugs, including 11 hepatic events; all adverse reactions",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.973467826843262,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        651.1102905273438,
        338.5533142089844,
        665.5532836914062
      ],
      "text": "except three occurred in the first eight weeks of treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.47807312011719,
        672.704345703125,
        527.4042358398438,
        687.25732421875
      ],
      "text": "GDG considerations:  The GDG judged that while the desirable effects related to this PICO question",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        686.0142211914062,
        527.5940551757812,
        700.4572143554688
      ],
      "text": "are related to treatment outcomes, shortening the duration of treatment is also important and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        718.2369995117188,
        526.603759765625,
        731.9409790039062
      ],
      "text": "In the SHINE trial, children with Xpert MTB/RIF results had very low or low semi-quantitative results, or a negative result. Xpert Ultra  14",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        731.0370483398438,
        186.05010986328125,
        741.541015625
      ],
      "text": "was not used in the SHINE trial.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        740.271728515625,
        526.5990600585938,
        753.9757080078125
      ],
      "text": "In the SHINE trial, adherence was defined as the proportion of children who received an adequate amount of treatment (as defined in  15",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        753.0717163085938,
        526.5581665039062,
        763.57568359375
      ],
      "text": "the statistical analysis plan for both the intervention and control regimens; generally, a cut off of 80% of the allocated doses was used,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        762.6716918945312,
        450.50067138671875,
        773.1756591796875
      ],
      "text": "within a certain time frame of starting each phase of treatment (i.e. intensive phase versus continuation phase).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.23320007324219,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "20 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        172.25680541992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        326.14483642578125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Module 4: treatment and care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}